+## Infinite-class compactness/measurability gap
+Construction: Abstractly, take \(\Theta=\mathbb N\), \(V_\theta=1\), and attainable reward vectors
+\[
+C=\{c\in[0,1]^\mathbb N:c\text{ has finite support}\}.
